A||||12||RAREW66||Fieros at INDY!||||6||
Z||000000||RAREW66||06-25-2001||12:56 AM||||Drove down to Indianapolis Saturday to attend an all Pontiac show sponsered by the Indy GTO club.<P>What a blast to drive my 88 Formula on the the good old Brickyard. It was an experience that will last a lifetime. Shot off tons of pictures; and most importantly, pictures of fieros on the track.<P>A total of eight Fieros and one Mera drove the track. Sounds like this may turn into a Yearly event.<P>Had the opportunity to spend the day with Chris Moore and his Windstar; and the extra-special Fiero-Lisa with her purple GT. Great seeing you guys.<P>Fred Bartemeyer <BR>Co-Chairman Heartland Fieros||||reg||6
Z||000001||84Bill||06-25-2001||08:51 AM||||hehe, Windstar?||||reg||10
Z||000002||Formula88||06-25-2001||09:01 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 84Bill:<BR><B>hehe, Windstar?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah, didn't you hear, Chris is building Ford Fiero Minivans now.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Actually, RAREW66, that would be <B>Northstar</B>, not Windstar.  A Windstar is a Ford minivan.  A Northstar is the Cadillac 32 valve V8.  Slight difference.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||firstfiero||06-25-2001||10:12 AM||||   windstar...sminstar...WHERES THOSE PICTURES!<P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">         <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||5
