Z||000010||RAREW66||06-25-2001||07:00 PM||||<BR>Actually, RAREW66, that would be <B>Northstar</B>, not Windstar.  A Windstar is a Ford minivan.  A Northstar is the Cadillac 32 valve V8.  Slight difference.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">[/B][/QUOTE]<P>Hey, you guys are quick. Chris is such a good guy that he is bound to get some teas'in. His two Northstars are two awesome cars and I call them Windstars as a joke. <P>To all of you, I will try to be more public about this event next year. The Indy GTO club gave our Fieros a warm welcome and invited us back. And yes, it was a thrill to be on that track on such a beautiful day.<P>Fred Bartemeyer<BR>Co-Chairman Heartland Fieros||||reg||1
